# Netlify processes THIS file's rules before netlify.toml's [[redirects]] —
# so the actual proxy rule has to live here, not there, or its catch-all
# below silently swallows everything first (confirmed: an /api/* rule in
# netlify.toml alone never matched, because this file's catch-all always won).
#
# Proxies the backend through this same origin so session cookies are
# genuinely first-party — see netlify.toml's own comment for the full
# reasoning (cross-site SameSite=Lax cookies don't reliably survive a
# fetch()/XHR round trip in a real browser, confirmed live in production).
/api/*  https://172-236-149-148.sslip.io/:splat  200!

